//! Loan and move checking over one prepared body's actual source graph.
//!
//! [`prepare`] reserves occurrence, storage, result, and ownership evidence; binds the
//! ordered policy observations; and solves one Program. [`checkPrepared`] consumes that
//! ephemeral analysis to classify conflicts, escapes, and region requirements before
//! the typed body is published. [`Analysis.sources`] exposes the same immutable graph.
//!
//! Current contents come from paired canonical definitions and reads. Descriptor identity,
//! physical address proofs, ownership holdings, and semantic placement remain distinct.
//! Copies retain their exact source Cases; overwritten storage cannot replace an earlier
//! operand's evidence. Cleanup and owner endings follow the actual traversal trace.
//!
//! The proof uses prepared original contracts and retained caller premises, without reading
//! callee bodies or MIR. Missing source, address, placement, or region evidence stays
//! noncertifying. Recovery coverage and unauthenticated external outcomes cannot produce
//! `Checked`. Conflicts retain their original codes and source spans.

